# Test: multiple_union_options_changed

## Old Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users:
    post:
      operationId: createUser
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                status:
                  oneOf:
                    - type: string
                      enum: [active]
                    - type: string
                      enum: [inactive]
                    - type: string
                      enum: [pending]
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## New Spec:
```yaml
openapi: 3.0.0
info:
  title: Test API
  version: 1.0.0
paths:
  /users:
    post:
      operationId: createUser
      requestBody:
        content:
          application/json:
            schema:
              type: object
              properties:
                status:
                  oneOf:
                    - type: string
                      enum: [active]
                    - type: string
                      enum: [suspended]
                    - type: string
                      enum: [deleted]
                    - type: string
                      enum: [archived]
      responses:
        '200':
          description: Success
```

## Compact Mode:
## Typescript SDK Changes:
* `sdk.createUser()`: 
